---
layout: policy.njk
title: "Proven Advantage animation options: Sage"
description: "The current Proven Advantage, converted to dots, and four new dot-matrix concepts."
noindex: true
permalink: /concepts/yes-dots/
steps:
  - tag: "01 · Expert incubation"
    q: "Can our vision <strong>be incubated and grow with AI/ML experts?</strong>"
    status: "Fully Supported &amp; Tailored"
  - tag: "02 · Direct assistance"
    q: "Can we access <strong>hands-on technical support?</strong>"
    status: "99.99% Uptime &amp; Founder Access"
  - tag: "03 · Speed to market"
    q: "Can our team <strong>accelerate from idea to impact quickly?</strong>"
    status: "Production Ready in Days"
options:
  - id: current
    tag: "01 · Today's, in dots"
    name: "The current one, in dots"
    desc: "The live section exactly, sideways row and all, rebuilt in dots. The stem is a curving line of dots that lights to the middle of the screen as the row moves; at each question a pair of dot leaves opens from its node and the outlined YES fills with purple dots from the left; small dot leaves bud between; and at the answer the plant flowers, a spike of dot florets climbing to a bud."
  - id: spell
    tag: "02 · Recommended"
    name: "One letter per answer"
    desc: "A wall of dots across the top of the screen, a giant YES! waiting in it, unlit. Each question you scroll through answers with one letter: the Y lights for the first, the E for the second, the S for the third, and the answer lights the ! and the whole word flashes. The YES is earned, letter by letter."
  - id: morph
    tag: "03 · Transformation"
    name: "Question becomes YES"
    desc: "Every question starts as a big question mark of grey dots. As you scroll, the very same dots lift off and fly, on curving paths, to rearrange themselves into a purple YES; then they gather back into a question mark for the next one. Doubt, literally turned into YES, by the scroll."
  - id: board
    tag: "04 · LED"
    name: "Departures board"
    desc: "A dark LED board, like a station's, in the light page. Each question runs across the ticker at its foot; its row's status blinks ?, then scrambles through the alphabet and locks on YES, in purple. The last row is the answer, YES!. The most literal dot matrix there is."
  - id: receipt
    tag: "05 · Playful"
    name: "Printed proof"
    desc: "A small dot-matrix printer prints the proof as you scroll: a receipt rises out of it, line by line, each question then its ANSWER .... YES and its status, ending on TOTAL .... YES! in purple, a barcode and a thank you. Proven, on paper."
---
{# Ways to animate Proven Advantage (section 04, home-sections.njk) in the dot-matrix hero's
   language. 01 is the live section (scripts.njk, 13) rebuilt in dots; 02 to 05 are new. Each holds
   the screen while you scroll through its questions, driven by the scroll so it runs backwards too,
   and each has its own phone layout. Everything is scoped under .yp- (01 reuses the live .yes-
   classes, under data-yp="current", which scripts.njk doesn't touch) #}
{% macro panels() %}
<div class="yp-panel" data-at="0">
  <h3 class="section-title">With Sage the answer is <span class="text-accent">YES!</span></h3>
  <p class="section-lede">As a Technical Capital Solution, we empower projects to grow quickly, with our decades of hands-on expertise, open-source innovation, and lock-in-free flexibility.</p>
</div>
{% for s in steps %}<div class="yp-panel" data-at="{{ loop.index }}"><p class="yp-tag">{{ s.tag }}</p><p class="yp-q">{{ s.q | safe }}</p><p class="yp-status">{{ s.status | safe }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
<div class="yp-panel" data-at="4"><p class="yp-tag">The answer</p><p class="yp-q">Are your projects fully ready for <strong>bold breakthroughs?</strong></p><p class="yp-status">When working with Sage.is, the answer is absolutely YES!</p></div>
{% endmacro %}

<style>
  .yp-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px var(--gutter); padding: 20px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .yp-intro > div { grid-column: 2 / -1; }
  .yp-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.05em; }
  .yp-intro p { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 60ch; font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.2vw, 1.375rem); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .yp-jump { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 22px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 90%, transparent); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); list-style: none; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .yp-jump a { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .yp-jump b { margin-right: 6px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .yp-option { margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw); padding-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 120px); scroll-margin-top: 50px; }
  .yp-cap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px var(--gutter); padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 7%, transparent); }
  .yp-cap > p:first-child { font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .yp-cap > p:last-child { grid-column: 2 / -1; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .yp-cap b { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ink); }

  /* 01: the live section, its words and stem drawn in dots */
  [data-yp="current"] .yes-word { -webkit-text-stroke: 0; }
  [data-yp="current"] .yes-word::after { display: none; }
  .yp-track-canvas { position: absolute; left: 0; pointer-events: none; }

  /* 02 to 05: a screen held while the scroll runs through it */
  .yp-pin { position: relative; height: 520vh; }
  .yp-stage { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100svh; overflow: hidden; }
  .yp-stage > canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
  .yp-top { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: clamp(20px, 4vh, 40px); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .yp-count { font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .yp-count b { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .yp-bar { position: absolute; left: var(--gutter); right: var(--gutter); bottom: clamp(18px, 3.5vh, 32px); height: 2px; background: var(--line); }
  .yp-bar i { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #302aff, #971aff); transform-origin: 0 50%; transform: scaleX(var(--p, 0)); }

  /* The words: one panel at a time. Where they sit is set per option below */
  .yp-panel { position: absolute; left: var(--gutter); right: var(--gutter); opacity: 0; translate: 0 14px; transition: opacity 0.4s ease, translate 0.6s var(--ease); pointer-events: none; }
  .yp-panel.is-on { opacity: 1; translate: 0 0; pointer-events: auto; }
  .yp-panel .section-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 4.25rem); }
  .yp-panel .section-lede { margin-top: 16px; max-width: 34em; }
  .yp-tag { font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .yp-q { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 22em; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -0.045em; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .yp-q strong { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .yp-status { margin-top: 16px; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.2vw, 1.25rem); color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .yp-status::before { content: "✓ "; }

  /* 02: the wall across the top, the words under it */
  [data-yp="spell"] .yp-panel { top: 62%; }
  /* 03: the words left, the dots right; on phones, the dots on top */
  [data-yp="morph"] .yp-panel { top: 50%; right: auto; width: min(46%, 600px); translate: 0 calc(-50% + 14px); }
  [data-yp="morph"] .yp-panel.is-on { translate: 0 -50%; }
  /* 04: the board up top, the words under it */
  [data-yp="board"] .yp-panel { top: 66%; text-align: center; }
  [data-yp="board"] .yp-panel .yp-q { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.875rem); margin-inline: auto; }
  [data-yp="board"] .yp-panel .section-lede { margin-inline: auto; }
  [data-yp="board"] .yp-panel .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.8vw, 3rem); }
  /* 05: the words left, the printer right; on phones the heading only until printing starts */
  [data-yp="receipt"] .yp-panel { top: 50%; right: auto; width: min(44%, 560px); translate: 0 calc(-50% + 14px); }
  [data-yp="receipt"] .yp-panel.is-on { translate: 0 -50%; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .yp-intro, .yp-cap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .yp-intro > div, .yp-cap > p:last-child { grid-column: 1; }
    .yp-q { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 2rem); }
    .yp-panel .section-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 9vw, 2.5rem); }
    [data-yp="spell"] .yp-panel { top: 46%; }
    [data-yp="morph"] .yp-panel { top: auto; bottom: 10svh; width: auto; right: var(--gutter); translate: 0 14px; }
    [data-yp="morph"] .yp-panel.is-on { translate: 0 0; }
    [data-yp="board"] .yp-panel { top: 40%; }
    [data-yp="receipt"] .yp-panel { top: 14svh; width: auto; right: var(--gutter); translate: 0 14px; }
    [data-yp="receipt"] .yp-panel.is-on { translate: 0 0; }
    [data-yp="receipt"] .yp-panel:not([data-at="0"]) { display: none; }
  }
</style>

